---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Madeleine Smith"
  description="Research brain, curious about everything, still asking questions."
>
  <header class="intro">
    <h1>Madeleine Smith</h1>
  </header>

  <section class="lede" aria-label="About">
    <div class="lede-body">
      <span class="accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Hi, I'm Maddie.</p>
      <p>
        Every data system, governance structure, and software service has
        something that isn't working for the people who rely on it. I love
        figuring out what and building what's missing.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've been doing that at nonprofits for almost eight years, building
        relationships with everyone from the people using the tools to the
        funders paying for them. I'm ready to do it in tech. For me, it's always
        been about understanding people, evaluating what's working, and making
        it better.
      </p>
      <p>
        I live in San Francisco with my husband Chris and two cats. I think
        about the environment a lot. I also read constantly, write poems and
        songs, and improvise whenever I can — on stage and on the dance floor.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img class="portrait" src="/maddy.png" alt="Madeleine Smith" />
  </section>

  <div class="columns">
  <section class="group" aria-labelledby="projects-label">
    <h2 class="group-label" id="projects-label">Projects</h2>

    <a class="project" href="https://www.calnature.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <div class="project-hero">
        <img src="/calnature-screenshot.png" alt="California Nature Dashboard — a map of California with rivers and reservoirs marked." />
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <h3 class="project-title">California Nature Dashboard</h3>
        <p class="project-desc">
          A living survey of California's ecosystems — tides, rivers, reservoirs,
          monarch migration, pollinators, and birds. Real-time data from NOAA, USGS,
          eBird, and iNaturalist.
        </p>
        <ul class="tags">
          <li>Dashboard</li>
          <li>With Chris Balin</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="group" aria-labelledby="pastwork-label">
    <h2 class="group-label" id="pastwork-label">Past work</h2>

    <ol class="entries">
      <li class="entry">
        <a class="entry-link" href="/when-the-product-was-the-problem">
          <h3 class="entry-title">When the Product Was the Problem</h3>
          <p class="entry-desc">
            Designing a tiered engagement model for a 15-partner network with no margin for churn.
          </p>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="entry entry--coming">
        <span class="entry-flag">Coming soon</span>
        <h3 class="entry-title">Whose Theory of Change?</h3>
        <p class="entry-desc">
          Participatory Logic Model design with frontline staff at a poverty alleviation non-profit.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="entry entry--coming">
        <span class="entry-flag">Coming soon</span>
        <h3 class="entry-title">Designing for Restoration Not Extraction</h3>
        <p class="entry-desc">
          Pre-framework discovery for knowledge management systems.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="entry entry--coming">
        <span class="entry-flag">Coming soon</span>
        <h3 class="entry-title">Rigor as an Equity Practice</h3>
        <p class="entry-desc">
          Qualitative analysis of poverty alleviation non-profits: first cross-program client survey.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="group" aria-labelledby="writing-label">
    <h2 class="group-label" id="writing-label">Writing</h2>

    <ol class="entries">
      <li class="entry entry--coming">
        <span class="entry-flag">Coming soon</span>
        <h3 class="entry-title">AI isn't conscious. You're just lonely.</h3>
        <p class="entry-desc">
          An eco-feminist perspective on the narrative that AI has consciousness.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  </div>

  <footer class="site-foot">
    <ul class="contact">
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/madeleineesmith">LinkedIn</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="built">Built with Claude</p>
  </footer>
</Base>
